Rule 6 (If a tensor has a floating point dtype, the minimum value must be less than the maximum value)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8 then min(v_1) ≤ max(v_1)
