{v_1 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 10 then ndim(v_1) > 0
>>
Rule 8 (If tensor dtype is bool, all the tensor's values should be true or all values should be false)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 0 then (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0)
